From 3d6fe913a5927ccb49282a14f5dcd0f66e397096 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 13:17:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Lighter listings UI: hover-only select mark, simplified
 filters, List view

- The selection checkbox on each property card now only appears on
  hover, focus, or once picked, instead of sitting on every card at
  all times.
- The filter bar shows just Location, Type and Bedrooms up front;
  Search, Sale/Rent, Status, price range, Floor, Whose listing, Agent
  and Owner move behind a "More filters" toggle (auto-expanded if one
  of those fields already has a value applied).
- Added a List view (next to Grid and Table): each property as a
  compact horizontal row instead of a card, via a new
  templates/properties/_row.html partial.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016tuWiGwhPRZEv1TzRpDFYk
